    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44769" root="&#xA;                        وهم&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْهَمَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He made him to think</i> [or <i>imagine</i>
a thing]; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهَّمَهُ</span></b> . (S, K.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْهَمَهُ كَذَا</span>
                        <i>He made him to think,</i> or <i>suspect, such a thing.</i>
(MA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See 8. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْهَمَ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهِمَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْهَمَ فِيهِ</span>
also signifies <i>He doubted respecting it.</i> (Mgh.)

